{
  "$schema": "../node_modules/@stryker-mutator/core/schema/stryker-schema.json",
  "mutate": [
    "packages/dsh-mcp-manager/src/client/float/panel.ts",
    "packages/dsh-mcp-manager/src/client/core/state.ts",
    "!packages/dsh-mcp-manager/src/**/interface.ts",
    "!packages/dsh-mcp-manager/src/server/*/deps.ts",
    "!packages/dsh-mcp-manager/src/server/*/*/deps.ts"
  ],
  "testRunner": "vitest",
  "mutator": {
    "excludedMutations": [
      "StringLiteral",
      "ArrayLiteral",
      "ObjectLiteral",
      "TemplateLiteral"
    ]
  },
  "plugins": [
    "@stryker-mutator/vitest-runner"
  ],
  "concurrency": 16,
  "timeoutMS": 60000,
  "dryRunTimeoutMinutes": 5,
  "reporters": [
    "progress",
    "clear-text",
    "json"
  ],
  "coverageAnalysis": "perTest",
  "tempDirName": ".stryker-tmp",
  "cleanTempDir": true,
  "vitest": {
    "related": false,
    "configFile": "vitest.stryker.d/dsh-mcp-manager-client-panel.config.ts"
  },
  "jsonReporter": {
    "fileName": "coverage/mutation/dsh-mcp-manager-client-panel.json"
  },
  "incremental": true,
  "incrementalFile": "coverage/mutation/incremental-mcp-manager-client-panel.json",
  "_comment": "新增（#947）：面板 aria-modal 同步 + opener 还焦 + Esc 让位——直连判据两份（test/client-dom/panel-aria-modal.test.ts，happy-dom 直连 src；test/client-unit/client-context-s2.test.ts，P3-b/B5 S2 ctx 最小面直测，所测 state.ts 归属本段、session/float 暂无归属段故同落，k 约 0）。P3-b/B6 并入 settings-card 直测（test/client-dom/settings-card.test.ts，happy-dom 直连 settings-card.tsx 六映射 L25/L37/L56/L67/L80/L136，所测 settings-card.tsx 暂无归属段故同落本段，k 约 0；不新建段）。只含本次有判据的三文件，其余客户端文件仍由覆盖率按面收窄逐个移入；float.ts Esc 一行暂无直连判据，随后续补判据后移入本段。"
}
